<script lang="ts">
 let apiKey=$state(''),secretKey=$state(''),passphrase=$state(''),origin=$state('https://www.okx.com'),allocation=$state(100),ownershipConfirmed=$state(false),riskAccepted=$state(false),adult=$state(false),busy=$state(false),message=$state(''),success=$state(false);
 async function connect(event:SubmitEvent){event.preventDefault();busy=true;message='';success=false;try{const r=await fetch('/api/broker',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({credentials:{apiKey,secretKey,passphrase,origin},allocation,ownershipConfirmed,riskAccepted,adult})});const result=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(result.error??result.message??'Connection failed');success=true;message=result.reason;}catch(e){message=e instanceof Error?e.message:String(e);}finally{apiKey='';secretKey='';passphrase='';busy=false;}}
</script>
<svelte:head></svelte:head>
<main><a class="brand" href="/">⬡ Omie<span>Bot</span></a><nav><a href="/live">Live Workspace</a><a href="/paper">Paper Workspace</a><a href="/login">Sign in</a></nav><span class="tag">YOUR ACCOUNT. YOUR ALLOCATION.</span><h1>Connect your<br/><span>OKX live account.</span></h1><p>OmieBot verifies the account with OKX before saving an encrypted connection. Credentials stay on the server. This form does not deposit funds or activate automatic trading.</p>
<aside>Create a dedicated API key in your own OKX account. Use Read and Trade permissions, with <strong>withdrawal permission disabled</strong>. Select the API region that belongs to your account. Never share a key for someone else’s account.</aside>
<div class="layout"><form onsubmit={connect} autocomplete="off"><h2>Verify and link</h2><label>OKX API region<select bind:value={origin}><option value="https://www.okx.com">Global · www.okx.com</option><option value="https://openapi.okx.com">Global · openapi.okx.com</option><option value="https://us.okx.com">United States · us.okx.com</option><option value="https://eea.okx.com">EEA · eea.okx.com</option></select></label><label>API key<input type="password" bind:value={apiKey} minlength="8" maxlength="200" required autocomplete="off"/></label><label>Secret key<input type="password" bind:value={secretKey} minlength="8" maxlength="200" required autocomplete="new-password"/></label><label>API passphrase<input type="password" bind:value={passphrase} minlength="8" maxlength="200" required autocomplete="new-password"/></label><label>Allocated USDT<input type="number" bind:value={allocation} min="100" step="0.01" required/></label><p class="fine">Minimum 100 USDT. Your chosen allocation must not exceed available USDT verified in your OKX trading account. Funding takes place directly at OKX.</p><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" bind:checked={adult} required/>I am at least 18 years old.</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" bind:checked={ownershipConfirmed} required/>I own and control this OKX account and authorize OmieBot to verify and store this encrypted API connection.</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" bind:checked={riskAccepted} required/>I understand trading can lose money, the limits below are defaults rather than a guarantee, and connecting does not enable automated orders.</label><button disabled={busy||!adult||!ownershipConfirmed||!riskAccepted}>{busy?'Verifying directly with OKX…':'Verify and encrypt connection ↗'}</button>{#if message}<p role="status" class:success>{message}</p>{/if}{#if success}<a href="/live">View verified live account →</a>{/if}</form><section><span class="tag">STARTING RISK POLICY</span><h2>Bounded by your allocation.</h2><dl><div><dt>Chosen allocation</dt><dd>{Number(allocation).toFixed(2)} USDT</dd></div><div><dt>Per-order maximum</dt><dd>{Math.min(25,Number(allocation)*.05).toFixed(2)} USDT</dd></div><div><dt>Total exposure ceiling</dt><dd>{(Number(allocation)*.2).toFixed(2)} USDT</dd></div><div><dt>Daily loss pause threshold</dt><dd>{(Number(allocation)*.02).toFixed(2)} USDT</dd></div><div><dt>New entries per day</dt><dd>4</dd></div><div><dt>Instrument scope</dt><dd>Spot only · no leverage</dd></div></dl><p>A daily-loss threshold cannot guarantee a maximum loss during gaps, outages or poor liquidity. Protective execution must still be verified against the venue.</p><strong>Automatic live execution: disabled</strong><p>This release connects and reads accounts. Instrument constraints, reconciled order execution and activation acceptance remain required before a bot can trade real capital.</p></section></div></main>
